(7557366, 1210863, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge. The guy''s got a great face, I kept expecting him to turn his head and look at me while I was voting... I''d have probably fainted on the spot..</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge. The guy''s got a great face, I kept expecting him to turn his head and look at me while I was voting... I''d have probably fainted on the spot..', '2018-02-04 13:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
