(7557379, 1210944, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s intriguing, but it''s not quite making it for me. I guess it says darkness around it -- but there''s so much light on the face, it''s not really about darkness, imo. But if I ignore that aspect of it, I''m not crazy about the crop. While I light negative space, this is making it feel a little squished on the left hand side. You''ve centered the person in the frame, but it''s not giving much space for her to look and there doesn''t seem to be a good reason to give the impression of squished-ness. I love the color and the lighting, though.</td>', 'It''s intriguing, but it''s not quite making it for me. I guess it says darkness around it -- but there''s so much light on the face, it''s not really about darkness, imo. But if I ignore that aspect of it, I''m not crazy about the crop. While I light negative space, this is making it feel a little squished on the left hand side. You''ve centered the person in the frame, but it''s not giving much space for her to look and there doesn''t seem to be a good reason to give the impression of squished-ness. I love the color and the lighting, though.', '2018-02-04 15:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
