(7557480, 1210967, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well done, Sweetie. Personally, I think it''s a masterpiece :-) For me, it has a very Hopper-esque feeling to it, nevermind that he didn''t typically do things soft and dark, but the LIGHT... It looks the way fog LOOKS, I guess, fog caught by surprise in the dark.</td>', 'Well done, Sweetie. Personally, I think it''s a masterpiece :-) For me, it has a very Hopper-esque feeling to it, nevermind that he didn''t typically do things soft and dark, but the LIGHT... It looks the way fog LOOKS, I guess, fog caught by surprise in the dark.', '2018-02-05 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
